# `cache_cap` breached at the pump: `cap_two_entries_at1` caps live keys at
# one and the rule writes two, so the breach is reported beside a firing that
# has already acted. The second pump does nothing. Realtime-only: its MANIFEST
# row is commented out.
assert Zone name=a threshold=10.0
assert Reading entity_id=r1 zone=a state=35.0
pump
pump
